<title>USA: Southern Investments U.K. sets $500 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Southern Investments U.K. sets $500 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-part debt issue from Southern Investments U.K. Plc was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER SOUTHERN INVESTMENTS U.K. PLC</p>
<p>AMT $168 MLN	 COUPON 6.375 PCT  MATURITY 11/15/2001</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 99.872  FIRST PAY DATE O5/15/1997 LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 6.405 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 48 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>BORROWER SOUTHERN INVESTMENTS U.K. PLC</p>
<p>AMT $332 MLN	 COUPON 6.80 PCT   MATURITY 12/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 99.753  FIRST PAY DATE O6/15/1997 LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 6.834 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 68 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>-- Corporate bond unit, 212-859-1678</p>
